 <Para 
  <Unique 1015266>
  <PgfTag `Heading2'>
  <PgfNumString `\t3.3\t'>
  <ParaLine 
   <String `Calibration Unit configuration'>
  > # end of ParaLine
 > # end of Para
 <Para 
  <Unique 1014503>
  <PgfTag `BodyAfterHead'>
  <ParaLine 
   <String `If the observe type is \xd2 OBJECT\xd3  or \xd2 SKY\xd3  all the calibration unit lamps are turned off. '>
  > # end of ParaLine
  <ParaLine 
   <String `If it is \xd2 ARC\xd3  or \xd2 FLAT\xd3  the configuration is controlled by the following '>
   <Font 
    <FTag `'>
    <FPlatformName `W.Times New Roman.I.400'>
    <FAngle `Italic'>
    <FEncoding `FrameRoman'>
    <FLocked No>
   > # end of Font
   <String `calibration '>
  > # end of ParaLine
  <ParaLine 
   <Font 
    <FTag `'>
    <FLocked No>
   > # end of Font
   <String `element parameters:'>
  > # end of ParaLine
 > # end of Para
 <Para 
  <Unique 1014507>
  <PgfTag `Description'>
  <ParaLine 
   <String `lamp'>
   <Char Tab>
   <String `The name of the lamp that should be switched on.'>
  > # end of ParaLine
 > # end of Para
 <Para 
  <Unique 1014508>
  <PgfTag `Description'>
  <ParaLine 
   <String `filter'>
   <Char Tab>
   <String `The name of the neutral density filter.'>
  > # end of ParaLine
 > # end of Para
 <Para 
  <Unique 1014509>
  <PgfTag `Description'>
  <ParaLine 
   <String `diffuser'>
   <Char Tab>
   <String `The name of the diffuser, either '>
   <Font 
    <FTag `'>
    <FPlatformName `W.Times New Roman.I.400'>
    <FAngle `Italic'>
    <FEncoding `FrameRoman'>
    <FLocked No>
   > # end of Font
   <String `IR '>
   <Font 
    <FTag `'>
    <FLocked No>
   > # end of Font
   <String `or '>
   <Font 
    <FTag `'>
    <FPlatformName `W.Times New Roman.I.400'>
    <FAngle `Italic'>
    <FEncoding `FrameRoman'>
    <FLocked No>
   > # end of Font
   <String `visible'>
   <Font 
    <FTag `'>
    <FLocked No>
   > # end of Font
   <String `.'>
  > # end of ParaLine
 > # end of Para
 <Para 
  <Unique 1015337>
  <PgfTag `Description'>
  <ParaLine 
   <String `shutter'>
   <Char Tab>
   <String `The state of the IR lamp shutter, either '>
   <Font 
    <FTag `'>
    <FPlatformName `W.Times New Roman.I.400'>
    <FAngle `Italic'>
    <FEncoding `FrameRoman'>
    <FLocked No>
   > # end of Font
   <String `open'>
   <Font 
    <FTag `'>
    <FLocked No>
   > # end of Font
   <String ` or '>
   <Font 
    <FTag `'>
    <FPlatformName `W.Times New Roman.I.400'>
    <FAngle `Italic'>
    <FEncoding `FrameRoman'>
    <FLocked No>
   > # end of Font
   <String `closed'>
   <Font 
    <FTag `'>
    <FLocked No>
   > # end of Font
   <String `.'>
   <Font 
    <FTag `'>
    <FPlatformName `W.Times New Roman.I.400'>
    <FAngle `Italic'>
    <FEncoding `FrameRoman'>
    <FLocked No>
   > # end of Font
  > # end of ParaLine
 > # end of Para
 <Para 
  <Unique 1014510>
  <PgfTag `Heading1'>
  <PgfNumString `\t4.0\t'>
  <ParaLine 
   <String `Sequence Execution'>
  > # end of ParaLine
 > # end of Para
 <Para 
  <Unique 1014511>
  <PgfTag `BodyAfterHead'>
  <ParaLine 
   <String `The execution of a step in a sequence happens in two phases; first the instrument, tele'>
   <Char SoftHyphen>
  > # end of ParaLine
  <ParaLine 
   <String `scope and calibration unit are configured and then, when all the systems indicate that '>
  > # end of ParaLine
  <ParaLine 
   <String `they are ready, the exposure is started. FITS header information is collected from the '>
  > # end of ParaLine
  <ParaLine 
   <String `TCS and its subsystems and the calibration unit as the exposure starts and when it fin'>
   <Char SoftHyphen>
  > # end of ParaLine
  <ParaLine 
   <String `ishes.'>
  > # end of ParaLine
 > # end of Para
 <Para 
  <Unique 1014512>
  <PgfTag `Body'>
  <ParaLine 
   <String `Configuring the calibration unit and, usually, the instrument, is straight-forward but '>
  > # end of ParaLine
  <ParaLine 
   <String `configuring the telescope is often not. This is because offsetting the telescope by more '>
  > # end of ParaLine
  <ParaLine 
   <String `than a few arcseconds requires that guiding is turned off'>
   <FNote 48>
   <String ` while the move is executed '>
  > # end of ParaLine
  <ParaLine 
   <String `and the configuration of tip/tilt guiding and M1 active optics correction after the move '>
  > # end of ParaLine
  <ParaLine 
   <String `also depends on which guide probes are tracking guide stars.'>
  > # end of ParaLine
 > # end of Para
 <Para 
  <Unique 1014520>
  <PgfTag `Body'>
  <ParaLine 
   <String `After each move of the telescope the sequencer attempts to configure the guiding and ao '>
  > # end of ParaLine
  <ParaLine 
   <String `correction to match the state read from the TCS when the '>
   <Font 
    <FTag `'>
    <FPlatformName `W.Times New Roman.I.400'>
    <FAngle `Italic'>
    <FEncoding `FrameRoman'>
    <FLocked No>
   > # end of Font
   <String `Configure from TCS'>
   <Font 
    <FTag `'>
    <FLocked No>
   > # end of Font
   <String ` button '>
  > # end of ParaLine
  <ParaLine 
   <String `was pressed taking in to consideration which wave-front sensors are tracking a guide '>
  > # end of ParaLine
  <ParaLine 
   <String `star as a result of the '>
   <Font 
    <FTag `'>
    <FPlatformName `W.Times New Roman.I.400'>
    <FAngle `Italic'>
    <FEncoding `FrameRoman'>
    <FLocked No>
   > # end of Font
   <String `guideWith'>
   <Font 
    <FTag `'>
    <FLocked No>
   > # end of Font
   <String ` parameter settings for the step. It will also not enable '>
  > # end of ParaLine
  <ParaLine 
   <String `guiding with the on-instrument wave-front sensor if the science fold mirror is blocking '>
  > # end of ParaLine
  <ParaLine 
   <String `the instrument\xd5 s view of the sky.'>
  > # end of ParaLine
 > # end of Para
 <Para 
